# URL exclusions for lychee (one regex per line) — see lychee.toml for the
# behavioral configuration. Everything here is unreachable from the scanner or
# deliberately unverifiable, NOT known-dead links we are hiding.
#
# Tailnet-only hosts: resolvable and reachable only inside the Tailscale
# network; the scanner (Temporal worker / CI) is deliberately outside it.
^https?://[^/]*\.tailnet-1a49\.ts\.net
^https?://[^/]*\.ts\.net
# Internal-only *.sjer.red services (auth-walled ingress endpoints, not public
# pages). Public sites — sjer.red, public.sjer.red, resume.sjer.red,
# webring.sjer.red, stocks.sjer.red, cook.sjer.red, scout-for-lol.com — are
# deliberately NOT excluded and are checked every run.
^https?://temporal-sleep\.sjer\.red
^https?://temporal-agent-tasks\.sjer\.red
^https?://pr-bot\.sjer\.red
# Golink shorthand only resolves inside the tailnet.
^https?://go/
# In-cluster Kubernetes service DNS.
^https?://[^/]*\.svc\.cluster\.local
# Documentation placeholders (RFC 2606 reserved names).
^https?://([^/]*\.)?example\.(com|org|net)
^https?://[^/]*\.invalid
^https?://[^/]*\.test(/|$)
^https?://[^/]*\.example(/|$)
